What environment do you have? Is linux-x86_64 correct?&lt;br/&gt;
I&apos;m using Linux Mint 19.1 and it works fine. Travis builds also succeed after this change. &lt;br/&gt;
The version number of the plugin and the protobuf version number are not in a tight relation. It should work fine as is.&lt;br/&gt;
The latest plugin version is &lt;tt&gt;3.6.0.2&lt;/tt&gt;. Could you please try upgrading if it fixes your problem?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
