                            <comment id="16744042" author="gszadovszky" created="Wed, 16 Jan 2019 13:35:15 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hi &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=junjie&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;junjie&quot;&gt;junjie&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So far, you are the only one who has issues with this plugin. Instead of downgrading the plugin globally, I would suggest to use the plugin version which works for you as a workaround and file an issue for the plugin at &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/os72/protoc-jar-maven-plugin/issues&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/os72/protoc-jar-maven-plugin/issues&lt;/a&gt;. Let&apos;s see, if they can say something. &lt;br/&gt;
(Maybe, you&apos;d like to execute the maven command with &lt;tt&gt;-X&lt;/tt&gt; and &lt;tt&gt;-e&lt;/tt&gt; so you&apos;ll get some more info.)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Keep this issue open until we know more about the problem.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
