                            <comment id="16747730" author="gszadovszky" created="Mon, 21 Jan 2019 07:54:16 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Since it turned out the issue is at the plugin side I&apos;m closing this one.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17290803" author="gszadovszky" created="Thu, 25 Feb 2021 09:33:43 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;We have also hit by this issue in our internal environment so I&apos;ve looked into the bug report of the plugin. It seems I was to fast closing this issue as even the plugin has the bug we still need to upgrade to the version where it is fixed. Also it seems safer to use &lt;tt&gt;protocArtifact&lt;/tt&gt; instead of &lt;tt&gt;protocVersion&lt;/tt&gt; to be 100% sure that the actual maven settings takes place when downloading the binaries.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
